    "title": "Established therapy company opens Rio Rancho location - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michaela Helean/Observer ,\n6 hours ago\nRIO RANCHO — After more than three decades in Albuquerque, therapy office The Community Lighthouse has opened a location in Rio Rancho. Company representative Meridyth Stefhon said though they are based in Albuquerque a lot of their referrals have come from Rio Rancho. “We work with schools in Albuquerque,...\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
